##
## Upstream tests to disable
##
## When adding a new filter to this list, please include a short description of
## why the filter is required and create an associated tracking issue.
##

# These tests expect stack traces to be symbolized (`ScopedDisallowBlocking`,
# `testing::UnitTest::Run`, ...), but stack traces on x86 Windows CI come out as
# "(No symbol)" even though `StackTrace::WillSymbolizeToStreamForTesting()`
# returns true.
-StackTraceTest.OutputToStream
-ThreadRestrictionsTest.BlockingCheckEmitsStack
-ThreadRestrictionsTest.NestedAllowRestoresPreviousStack
